[Music]  tom holland is one of the biggest young  stars in hollywood today the 25 year old  actor was catapulted into international  stardom when he first suited up a  spider-man in 2016's captain america  civil war joining the marvel cinematic  universe is a sure-fire way to join the  hollywood a-list and holland was no  exception  all right kid  you're an avenger now  since becoming an avenger the british  actor has had the chance to show off his  acting chops in various non-superhero  films including the kriti war drama  cherry this 2021 flag proved to be  holland's biggest departure from the  wholesome nurse of the mcu it follows a  young former soldier who struggles with  ptsd after returning home from fighting  in iraq playing such a troubled and  nuanced character was quite the  challenge for holland too who has since  revealed just how much of a told the  film took on his health in an interview  with british gq tom holland revealed the  health difficulties he faced filming  cherry production began with the scenes  depicting holland's character in the  thrones of addiction and his appearance  had to reflect that revealing that his  trainer told him to eat only 500  calories a day and run 10 miles holland  remembered i lost around 27 pounds by  running in a bin bag every day while  this would be a difficult turn for any  actor it was made worse by the need to  bulk back up again for his scenes as an  army medic holland shared it was brutal  i got very sick actually and it's  changed my relationship with food  completely the experience was so  grueling that holland has sworn off  doing anything similar in the future in  the same interview with gq he said i  think i would find it very difficult to  find a role that would warrant that sort  of abuse on my body again holland  elaborated this role took me to some of  the darkest places i've ever been  emotionally physically anythingly i  would never go back there again not for  anyone i am pleased i did it but that  door is now closed and locked engaging  in such an intense physical  transformation for a role is difficult  for any actor while holland may not be  taking on such projects again many other  actors have undergone brutal  transformations for the sake of their  art christian bale for example might be  the star best known for his jaw-dropping  critical transformations he shocked  audiences in the 2004 thriller the  machinist playing an emaciated insomniac  the actor lost 66 pounds for the role  and was fully committed to truly  capturing his character shockingly just  six months after filming wrapped on the  machinist bale had to bulk up to play  bruce wayne in the first of christopher  nolan's batman movies batman begins the  actor quickly gained weight after his  machinist's role so much so that nolan  asked bail to actually lose weight yet  again bale later told train magazine i  gained too much weight in the run-up to  batman begins i wasn't the size that  christopher nolan wanted so i had to cut  down 20 pounds or so just before  shooting i was a lot beefier at first  and this was far from the last time bale  rapidly changed his physique he went  through a similarly rapid transformation  for 2010's the fighter playing a man  addicted to crack cocaine though a  pattern was emerging bale has shared  that he didn't actively seek out such  physically grueling roles he told mtv  news i didn't take this job because i  went oh there's a physical  transformation needed i always go damn  there's a physical transformation needed  tom holland and christian bale are far  from the only actors who have undergone  extreme physical transformations for a  role of course with the likes of matthew  mcconaughey charlize theron and joaquin  phoenix also known for dramatically  changing their appearances to suit a  character of course you've got to admire  these styles for their commitment to  their craft though it's hard to envy  them for the toll it takes on their  bodies and nobody could blame holland  for passing on the chance to do it again  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

